{"content":[{"c":["ELIEL"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Warrior and head of a family of the half-tribe of Manasseh that lived east of the Jordan River (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.5.24","r":"1Chr.5.24","rawR":"1Chr.5.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.5.24","value":"1Chr.5.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 5:24"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Tola’s son, a Kohathite who was one of the Levitical singers in the time of David (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.34","r":"1Chr.6.34","rawR":"1Chr.6.34","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.34","value":"1Chr.6.34"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:34"},"); possibly the same as Eliab (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.27","r":"1Chr.6.27","rawR":"1Chr.6.27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.27","value":"1Chr.6.27"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:27"},"). "],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 3. Shimei’s son and a chief of Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.20","r":"1Chr.8.20","rawR":"1Chr.8.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.20","value":"1Chr.8.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:20"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 4. Shashak’s son and a chief of Benjamin’s tribe (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.22","r":"1Chr.8.22","rawR":"1Chr.8.22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.22","value":"1Chr.8.22"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:22"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 5. Warrior among David’s mighty men (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.46","r":"1Chr.11.46","rawR":"1Chr.11.46","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.46","value":"1Chr.11.46"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:46"},"), called a Mahavite."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 6. Another warrior among David’s mighty men (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.47","r":"1Chr.11.47","rawR":"1Chr.11.47","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.47","value":"1Chr.11.47"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:47"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 7. Warrior from the Gadites who joined David at Ziklag in his struggle against King Saul. Eliel was one of those experts with a shield and spear. Whether the Eliel of ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.11","r":"1Chr.12.11","rawR":"1Chr.12.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.11","value":"1Chr.12.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 12:11"}," should be equated with either of the two Eliels of ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.46-47","r":"1Chr.11.46-47","rawR":"1Chr.11.46-47","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.46-47","value":"1Chr.11.46-47"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 11:46-47"}," is impossible to say."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 8. Levite and chief of the family of Hebron, who was involved in bringing the ark to Jerusalem in David’s time (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.15.9","r":"1Chr.15.9","rawR":"1Chr.15.9","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.15.9","value":"1Chr.15.9"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 15:9"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":[" 9. Priest who assisted in bringing the ark to Jerusalem (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.15.11","r":"1Chr.15.11","rawR":"1Chr.15.11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.15.11","value":"1Chr.15.11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 15:11"},"); possibly the same as #8 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["10. Levite who assisted Conaniah in the administration of the tithes, contributions, and dedicated things given to the temple during Hezekiah’s reign (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.31.13","r":"2Chr.31.13","rawR":"2Chr.31.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.31.13","value":"2Chr.31.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 31:13"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Eliel","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 5:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.5.24","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.5.24","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.5.24"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:34","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.34","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.34","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.34"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.27","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.27","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.27"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.20","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.20","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.20"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.22","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.22","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.22"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:46","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.46","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.46","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.46"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:47","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.47","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.47","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.47"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 12:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.12.11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.12.11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.12.11"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 11:46-47","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.46-47","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.46-47","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.46-47"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 15:9","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.15.9","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.15.9","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.15.9"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 15:11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.15.11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.15.11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.15.11"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 31:13","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.31.13","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.31.13","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.31.13"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"4cff39b0e0a3a7846df3fa4ad02545b07383213643b6813c9cbefbc85d3d1e8c","sourceItemName":"Eliel","sourceItemOrder":96,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Eliel","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Eliel","title":"Eliel","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}